OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Not again': Arrest of US marine for
OL,4,Amurder reignites protests in Japan's
OL,5,AOkinawa
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Nothing has changed since I was a
OL,8,Fchild. How many times are we going to
OL,9,Frepeat the same thing, create more
OL,10,Fvictims, cause their families to
OL,11,Fsuffer, and ultimately, cause the
OL,12,Fpeople of Okinawa to grieve?"
OL,14,FAkemi Oshiro, a 62-year-old Ginowan
OL,15,Fresident shared similar sentiments.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
